---
description: TFPT research modes (Exploration vs Continuation), user decision of 2026-11-20
alwaysApply: true
---

For TFPT research read `AGENTS.md` and pick the mode first.

- Exploration (new ideas, Neuansatz, broad search): follow
  `docs/research/EXPLORATION.md`; no PLAN/RESULTS/progress/Atlas before the
  idea phase is written down.
- Continuation (continue the plan or a named task): top of
  `docs/research/fundamental-plan/PLAN.md`, compact `progress.json`, newest
  `RESULTS.md`, then the live Atlas.

A past "Nächster Schritt" is never an obligation. Record results with source,
scope and verdict; preserve scoped negatives without treating them as a ban on
ideas with different premises.
